    "finding": "retire sends the representative to retirement_custody_hash and forbids the record continuation; it does not put the representative directly at the generic request script"
  },
  "conclusion": "No named-retirement escape established. The generic request-only NFT assumption is not the actual naming retirement layout. Actual custody refusal distinguishes the full required purpose set from three-handler acceptance. Preserve separate request/custody mapping and remaining authentic setup, representative burn-policy and ledger evidence."
